    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fork Frog is a Puzzle Game about stacking boxes.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a Frog</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are also a Fork Lift</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is to stack boxes until all boxes are part of a stack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can jump, pick up and release boxes!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, you will explore helpful tools, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All images used on this page are placeholder graphics. \ud83c\udf08</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fork Frog is a Puzzle Game about stacking boxes.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a Frog</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are also a Fork Lift</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is to stack boxes until all boxes are part of a stack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can jump, pick up and release boxes!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, you will explore helpful tools, including:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trains</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All images used on this page are placeholder graphics. \ud83c\udf08</p>",
